%% plan.mmd — Mermaid view for the 2026-08-24 compute-framework migration.
%% Render: mmdc -i plan.mmd -o plan.svg  (mermaid-cli absent on this host;
%% GitHub and most editors render this inline).
%%
%% Sequence view: how one SpMM travels through the framework, showing the
%% explicit encode/submit/readback boundary that distinguishes this design
%% from an auto-submitting one.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor App as HNN layer
    participant RT as ComputeRuntime (facade)
    participant Prep as PreparedSpmm
    participant Cpu as CpuBackend
    participant Gpu as WgpuBackend
    participant Dev as GPU device

    Note over App,Dev: preparation - once per matrix, not per call
    App->>RT: spmm_descriptor(csr, feature_dim)
    RT->>RT: select backend (size, residency, chain)

    alt CPU path
        RT->>Cpu: prepare(descriptor)
        Cpu-->>Prep: delegates to spmm_into_serial / _parallel
        Note right of Cpu: no new algorithm code;<br/>existing measured kernels
        App->>Prep: run(x, y)
        Prep-->>App: y filled, zero allocation
    else WGPU path
        RT->>Gpu: prepare(descriptor)
        Gpu->>Gpu: PipelineCache lookup (build once)
        Gpu->>Dev: upload CSR -> GpuCsrMatrix
        Gpu-->>Prep: PreparedSpmm (bind group cached)

        Note over App,Dev: steady state - CSR stays resident
        App->>Prep: encode(&mut encoder)
        Note right of Prep: NO submit here -<br/>several ops share one buffer
        App->>Gpu: submit(encoder)
        Gpu->>Dev: dispatch workgroups
        Dev-->>Gpu: done
        opt only at an explicit boundary
            App->>Gpu: readback(y)
            Gpu-->>App: host Vec<f32>
        end
    end

    Note over App,Dev: correctness gate
    App->>Cpu: same input via spmm_into_serial
    App->>App: compare abs+rel tolerance, NaN/Inf explicit
    Note right of App: bitwise equality NOT promised<br/>across devices
